msgid "botblocker/set-protection — turns protection on or off through the Dashboard path. Requires confirm \"ENABLE\" or \"DISABLE\"."
msgstr "botblocker/set-protection - active la protection ou la inactif via le chemin Tableau de bord. Nécessite la confirmation \" ENABLE \" ou \" DISABLE \"."

